  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The potential energy curve for the formation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> molecule as a function of internuclear distance of the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> atoms. The minima in the curve corresponds to the most stable state of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0b2b1712-2b04-4c4f-b9c5-ac6171a914a4-image.png\" style=\"width: 388px; height: 237px;\" /></p>",
